  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Ability to write empty object list to #PSALDO and #PBUDGET for type 2.\nOption to ignore #KSUMMA\nError handling for missing #VER for #TRAN, #BTRAN, #RTRAN.\nReader: SIE type check when reading file or stream.\nReader: ParsingLineNumber for easer debugging.\nReader: DIM handling according to standard.\nWriter: Write PROGRAM according to standard.\nWriter: Remove Carriage Return in SieText.\nWriter: Ability to add vouchers to file in batches\nWriter: More memory-efficient string handling\nHandle illegal characters in account and object names\nPrint object identities within quotes in objektlist\nWriter: Print Quantity to #PSALDO and #PBUDGET.",
